; Demo mode banner
;
; The banner shown in the top character row (screen address $4000, 32 characters) while the demonstration game is
; running: "DEMO MODE  PRESS ANY KEY TO PLAY". Printed by #R$6000 with #R$6B4F in place of the status line (#R$7C47);
; the first nine attribute cells ("DEMO MODE") are then set to flash.
; .
; Format: plain ASCII characters, terminated by $FF.
;
@label=DemoText
t$6AE7 DEFM "DEMO MODE  PRESS ANY KEY TO PLAY"
 $6B07 DEFB $FF
